<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Claim Update</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }
    .header { background: #6b7280; color: white; padding: 30px; text-align: center; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; }
    .content { background: #f9fafb; padding: 30px; border-radius: 0 0 8px 8px; }
    .footer { text-align: center; padding: 20px; color: #6b7280; font-size: 14px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="header">
    <h1>Claim Update</h1>
  </div>
  <div class="content">
    <p>Hi <%= @user.name || @user.email %>,</p>
    
    <p>Unfortunately, your claim for <strong><%= @stand.name %></strong> was not approved at this time.</p>
    
    <% if @claim.notes.present? %>
    <p><strong>Reason:</strong> <%= @claim.notes %></p>
    <% end %>
    
    <p>If you believe this was a mistake or would like more information, please contact us.</p>
    
    <p>- The MyStandMap Team</p>
  </div>
  <div class="footer">
    <p>© <%= Date.current.year %> MyStandMap - Connecting Wisconsin with Local Food</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
